 it, rules run on it, and the Wolf UI is served from it at ",[202,212,213],{},"\u002Fwolf",".",[216,217,219],"h2",{"id":218},"requirements","Requirements",[221,222,223,227,234],"ul",{},[224,225,226],"li",{},"Frappe 15 or Dokos (Dodock 5). Tested on Dodock 5.18, MariaDB 10.6 and Postgres 16 and 17.",[224,228,229,230,233],{},"Node 20.19 or later on the bench, for ",[202,231,232],{},"bench build"," of the Wolf UI.",[224,235,236],{},"A scheduler running every minute (below).",[216,238,24],{"id":239},"install",[241,242,248],"pre",{"className":243,"code":244,"filename":245,"language":246,"meta":247,"style":247},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","cd ~\u002Ffrappe-bench\nbench get-app https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fbthuner\u002Fdodock-wolf\nbench --site wolf.example.com install-app dodock_wolf\nbench build --app dodock_wolf   # links the static assets and builds the Wolf UI (\u002Fwolf)\nbench set-config -g scheduler_tick_interval 60\n","bench","bash","",[202,249,250,263,275,292,310],{"__ignoreMap":247},[251,252,255,259],"span",{"class":253,"line":254},"line",1,[251,256,258],{"class":257},"s2Zo4","cd",[251,260,262],{"class":261},"sfazB"," ~\u002Ffrappe-bench\n",[251,264,266,269,272],{"class":253,"line":265},2,[251,267,245],{"class":268},"sBMFI",[251,270,271],{"class":261}," get-app",[251,273,274],{"class":261}," https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fbthuner\u002Fdodock-wolf\n",[251,276,278,280,283,286,289],{"class":253,"line":277},3,[251,279,245],{"class":268},[251,281,282],{"class":261}," --site",[251,284,285],{"class":261}," wolf.example.com",[251,287,288],{"class":261}," install-app",[251,290,291],{"class":261}," dodock_wolf\n",[251,293,295,297,300,303,306],{"class":253,"line":294},4,[251,296,245],{"class":268},[251,298,299],{"class":261}," build",[251,301,302],{"class":261}," --app",[251,304,305],{"class":261}," dodock_wolf",[251,307,309],{"class":308},"sHwdD","   # links the static assets and builds the Wolf UI (\u002Fwolf)\n",[251,311,313,315,318,321,324],{"class":253,"line":312},5,[251,314,245],{"class":268},[251,316,317],{"class":261}," set-config",[251,319,320],{"class":261}," -g",[251,322,323],{"class":261}," scheduler_tick_interval",[251,325,327],{"class":326},"sbssI"," 60\n",[198,329,330],{},"Then restart the scheduler process.",[198,332,333],{},"Installing creates:",[221,335,336,347,358],{},[224,337,338,339,342,343,346],{},"the roles ",[207,340,341],{},"Wolf Manager"," (sees and configures everything) and ",[207,344,345],{},"Wolf User"," (read-only);",[224,348,349,350,353,354,357],{},"a random ",[207,351,352],{},"registration token"," in ",[207,355,356],{},"Wolf Settings",", used by agents to register;",[224,359,360,361,365],{},"the ",[362,363,364],"a",{"href":102},"preset alert rules",", with no channels.",[216,367,369],{"id":368},"scheduler-pace","Scheduler pace",[198,371,372],{},"Wolf's alert rules, rollups and satellite pushes are scheduled every minute. Frappe 15 and Dodock\ntick every 4 minutes by default.",[374,375,376],"warning",{},[198,377,378,379,382,383,386,387,390],{},"Without ",[202,380,381],{},"scheduler_tick_interval"," set to ",[202,384,385],{},"60",", an alert can come up to 4 minutes late, and \"fire\nafter 3 evaluations\" means 12 minutes. The Wolf UI's ",[207,388,389],{},"Monitoring"," page shows the pace in use.",[216,392,394],{"id":393},"the-wolf-ui","The Wolf UI",[198,396,397,400,401,403,404,406],{},[202,398,399],{},"https:\u002F\u002F\u003Csite>\u002Fwolf"," is the operator UI, a Vue app built on frappe-ui. It reuses the Frappe\nsession: guests go to the login page, users without ",[207,402,345],{}," or ",[207,405,341],{}," get a 403.\nDesk keeps the configuration DocTypes; a view the Wolf UI does not have yet links to Desk.",[408,409],"screenshot",{"alt":410,"caption":411,"name":412},"An incident in the Wolf UI","An incident: timeline, deployment marker, and the events grouped under it.","incident",[216,414,416],{"id":415},"signals-with-no-agent","Signals with no agent",[198,418,419,420,422,423,214],{},"The Wolf site watches itself as soon as the app is installed: failed Scheduled Job Logs, Error Logs\nand failed backups, failed desk logins, privileged logins from a new IP or country, role grants,\nEmail Queue backlogs and risky application changes. Each can be turned off in ",[207,421,356],{},".\nSee ",[362,424,129],{"href":130},[198,426,427,428,214],{},"To get the same signals from the bench's other sites, install the app there too, as\n",[362,429,430],{"href":41},"satellites",[216,432,434],{"id":433},"upgrade","Upgrade",[241,436,438],{"className":243,"code":437,"filename":245,"language":246,"meta":247,"style":247},"bench update --apps dodock_wolf   # or: cd apps\u002Fdodock_wolf && git pull\nbench --site wolf.example.com migrate\nbench build --app dodock_wolf\n",[202,439,440,455,466],{"__ignoreMap":247},[251,441,442,444,447,450,452],{"class":253,"line":254},[251,443,245],{"class":268},[251,445,446],{"class":261}," update",[251,448,449],{"class":261}," --apps",[251,451,305],{"class":261},[251,453,454],{"class":308},"   # or: cd apps\u002Fdodock_wolf && git pull\n",[251,456,457,459,461,463],{"class":253,"line":265},[251,458,245],{"class":268},[251,460,282],{"class":261},[251,462,285],{"class":261},[251,464,465],{"class":261}," migrate\n",[251,467,468,470,472,474],{"class":253,"line":277},[251,469,245],{"class":268},[251,471,299],{"class":261},[251,473,302],{"class":261},[251,475,291],{"class":261},[198,477,478,479,482],{},"Migrations never overwrite presets you edited. A ",[202,480,481],{},"bench migrate"," is recorded as a deployment on\nthe Wolf timeline.",[216,484,486],{"id":485},"next","Next",[198,488,489,492],{},[362,490,491],{"href":36},"Install the agent"," on each host.",[494,495,496],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s2Zo4, html code.shiki .s2Zo4{--shiki-light:#6182B8;--shiki-default:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--s